    https://github.com/TRUSTCHAIN-creator-KK/trustchain-protocol (CC BY 4.0)

Filling in a template for your own agreement? You do not need to put a credit
line inside that agreement. The credit applies when you publish or distribute
the templates themselves, or your own collection based on them.

